  first | exact @GlobalTheory.JR.norm_sub_notMem_of_not_norm | exact GlobalTheory.JR.norm_sub_notMem_of_not_norm | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.JR.norm_sub_notMem_of_not_norm <;> assumption)
